@base = http://localhost:5122

### list videos -> 200 ["kitten.mp4"]
GET {{base}}/api/videos

### thumbnail -> first frame (JPEG)
GET {{base}}/thumbnail/kitten.mp4

### thumbnail, missing file -> 500
GET {{base}}/thumbnail/nope.mp4

### start a job -> 202 { jobId }
# @name startJob
POST {{base}}/process/kitten.mp4?targetColor=FFA200&threshold=164

### missing params -> 400
POST {{base}}/process/kitten.mp4

### bad color -> 400
POST {{base}}/process/kitten.mp4?targetColor=zzz&threshold=164

### missing video -> 400
POST {{base}}/process/nope.mp4?targetColor=FFA200&threshold=164

### job status (uses the jobId from "start a job") -> processing, then done
GET {{base}}/process/{{startJob.response.body.jobId}}/status

### unknown job -> 404
GET {{base}}/process/fake-id/status

### result CSV (after status is done)
GET {{base}}/results/kitten.mp4.csv